    "title": "CurbSmart Parent",
    "description": "CurbSmart is the easy-to-use app that allows parents to enter the approved pickups for their children. Forget the hassle of submitting paper forms, phone calls, or emails every time you want another adult to pick up your child.\r\n \r\nWith CurbSmart, parents can\r\n   - Easily enter the adults who are approved to pick up their students\r\n   - Authorize alternate pickups for when students are riding home with a friend\r\n   - Enter vehicle and address information for increased security\r\n   - Receive a notification once the child has been safely released from school",
